## JSON — soft builtins

`json_get_i64(body, key) -> i64` — integer object field, or `-1` if missing.

`json_has_i64(body, key) -> i64` — `1` if `key` maps to an integer, else `0`
(distinguishes missing from a real `-1` value).

```
let body = "{\"n\": 42}"
let v = json_get_i64(body, "n")
let ok = json_has_i64(body, "n")
```

See `examples/05_http_json.ryx` and `examples/10_json_http_post.ryx`.
